---
description: Frontend conventions for the ZenBlog client
globs:
  - client/**/*.tsx
  - client/**/*.ts
---
API base response shape is always { data, errors } (BaseResult<T> from the backend).
Auth: POST /auth/login returns { userId, email, token, expiresAtUtc }. Store token
in memory/context, not localStorage directly, attach as Authorization: Bearer <token>.
Match backend DTO field casing exactly (see /client/src/api/types.ts, generated
from the backend's actual JSON, not guessed).
